{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27296","headline":"至人无梦 · 蒋防","name":"至人无梦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已赜希微理，知将静默邻。\n坐忘宁有梦，迹灭示凝神。\n化蝶诚知幻，徵兰匪契真。\n抱玄虽解带，守一自离尘。\n寥朗壶中晓，虚明洞里春。\n翛然碧霞客，那比漆园人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}